data: {"id": "941d16cafe084863-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "941d16cafe084863", "seq": 1628, "ts_ms": 1788410287882, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 49.401, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-02", "name": "workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/941d16cafe084863-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "dedf978d53828831080fc9d0b057fc1b40d6b53da7a088d7ae45a4cea75d7ab1", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "c31dca0d7c5bf1d078f88c4f454d3bcb8ed5239ca904b460650baabfe4b7670e"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "941d16cafe084863-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "941d16cafe084863", "seq": 1629, "ts_ms": 1788410287883, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "941d16cafe084863-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "941d16cafe084863", "seq": 1630, "ts_ms": 1788410295785, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 7.903, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1486, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": ... failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 确认网络层无法解析镜像域名，是导致拉取失败的直接原因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ImagePullBackOff` | 描述 Pod 当前等待状态的最终结果 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}` 值为 `1` | 独立于 K8s 事件的状态快照，印证 ImagePullBackOff 状态的确立 |\n| 4 | Logging | kubectl_logs | `container \"app\" in pod \"workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4\" is waiting to start: trying and failing to pull image` | 补充说明容器未进入运行态，排除了应用层日志缺失的可能性 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件记录明确指出了 `no such host` 这一核心错误，而 Metrics 指标确认了这一状态在监控维度同样被捕获；K8s 事件与 Metric 相互印证，共同锁定了“DNS 解析失败导致镜像拉取阻断”这一事实，逻辑链条完整。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置无效镜像域名 (registry.invalid) → 集群 DNS (127.0.0.53) 解析失败 → 镜像拉取终止 (no such host / ImagePullBackOff)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**镜像域名配置无效导致 DNS 解析失败**。\n\n证据（编号 1、2、3）显示 `registry.invalid` 是一个不可达或未被 DNS 记录的域名，致使 `kubelet` 在尝试拉取镜像时遭遇底层网络 DNS 查询失败（`dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`），进而触发了 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` | ImagePullBackOff | Pod workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": ... failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/workload/manifests/missing\": dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid on 127.0.0.53:53: no such host` | 确认网络层无法解析镜像域名，是导致拉取失败的直接原因 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `ImagePullBackOff` | 描述 Pod 当前等待状态的最终结果 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}` 值为 `1` | 独立于 K8s 事件的状态快照，印证 ImagePullBackOff 状态的确立 |\n| 4 | Logging | kubectl_logs | `container \"app\" in pod \"workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4\" is waiting to start: trying and failing to pull image` | 补充说明容器未进入运行态，排除了应用层日志缺失的可能性 |\n\n**证据分析：**\nKubernetes 事件记录明确指出了 `no such host` 这一核心错误，而 Metrics 指标确认了这一状态在监控维度同样被捕获；K8s 事件与 Metric 相互印证，共同锁定了“DNS 解析失败导致镜像拉取阻断”这一事实，逻辑链条完整。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 配置无效镜像域名 (registry.invalid) → 集群 DNS (127.0.0.53) 解析失败 → 镜像拉取终止 (no such host / ImagePullBackOff)\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为**镜像域名配置无效导致 DNS 解析失败**。\n\n证据（编号 1、2、3）显示 `registry.invalid` 是一个不可达或未被 DNS 记录的域名，致使 `kubelet` 在尝试拉取镜像时遭遇底层网络 DNS 查询失败（`dial tcp: lookup registry.invalid ... no such host`），进而触发了 `ImagePullBackOff` 状态。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

